  "instructions": [
    "Heat the render duck fat or vegetable oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and sauté for another minute.",
    "Add the diced bell peppers and sauté until they start to soften.",
    "Add the tomato paste and stir to combine.",
    "Add the turmeric, cumin, and mustard; stir to combine.",
    "Add the potato starch and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for about 5 minutes, until the mixture starts to crisp up.",
    "Fluff the mixture with a spatula, breaking up any clumps.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley, if desired."
